		"complexity": 3,
		"description": "<p>Most see the soul as a sacred mystery. You see it as a source of power. Why waste your life reading dusty scrolls or begging ancient horrors for a scrap of power? You have a direct line to the source. Every living thing carries a spark, and you know how to reach out, grab it and use it.</p><p>To be a Specter is to be the inescapable haunting in the room. You reach into the white noise of a living spirit and twist it into a shape that suits your needs. You don't just mark your enemies; you brand them. If they try to ignore your touch, they rot. If they try to fight it, they break. You thrive in that moment of desperate struggle. For a Specter, an enemy's willpower is just another weapon to be turned against them.</p><ul><li><p><strong>Soul Manipulation.</strong> Reach out and touch the inner self of those around you, leaving a mark that bends reality to your will.</p></li><li><p><strong>Inevitable Consequences.</strong> Turn their defense into your offense. Create traps that punish your enemies even when they succeed!</p></li><li><p><strong>Soul Sculpting.</strong> Select unique Soul Sculpting techniques to change how you shape a soul and claim your rightful power.</p></li></ul>",
